	(text "Check the pin order and count on your cable. Newer Waveshare modules have a 9th pin\n(PWR): if yours has it, use a 9-pin connector and tie PWR to +3V3.\nCable: needs a PH-to-PH 8-pin cable that maps pin 1 to pin 1 (beep it out before\npower-on). Option: 1x8 2.54 mm header (PinHeader_1x08_P2.54mm_Vertical) for the\nexisting jumper wires. Same pin order either way."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 147.32 0)
